{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04729","headline":"舞马千秋万岁乐府词三首 二 · 张说","name":"舞马千秋万岁乐府词三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣皇至德与天齐，天马来仪自海西。\n腕足徐行拜两膝，繁骄不进踏千蹄。\n髬髵奋鬣时蹲踏，鼓怒骧身忽上跻。\n更有衔杯终宴曲，垂头掉尾醉如泥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04729.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04729","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}